55:59.660 --> 56:00.920
assistants is trained

56:00.920 --> 56:01.940
on those very same

56:01.940 --> 56:02.660
repositories?

56:02.660 --> 56:03.720
Oh, man.

56:04.100 --> 56:04.920
If the current code

56:04.920 --> 56:06.040
being merged today is

56:06.040 --> 56:07.260
bloated, duplicated,

56:07.840 --> 56:08.680
structurally unsound,

56:08.780 --> 56:09.680
and entirely stripped

56:09.680 --> 56:11.440
of taste, are we

56:11.440 --> 56:12.540
currently polluting the

56:12.540 --> 56:13.600
very training data we

56:13.600 --> 56:14.160
need to build the

56:14.160 --> 56:14.420
future?

56:14.940 --> 56:16.620
Are we mathematically

56:16.620 --> 56:17.820
guaranteeing that

56:17.820 --> 56:19.280
tomorrow's AI will be

56:19.280 --> 56:20.260
fundamentally less

56:20.260 --> 56:21.240
capable of understanding

56:21.240 --> 56:22.340
elegant, secure,

56:22.700 --> 56:23.700
human-centric systems

56:23.700 --> 56:24.820
simply because we

56:24.820 --> 56:25.820
buried all the good

56:25.820 --> 56:26.900
historical examples

56:26.900 --> 56:27.720
under a mountain of

56:27.720 --> 56:28.640
synthetic slop today?

56:29.140 --> 56:30.580
We might literally be

56:30.580 --> 56:31.520
burning the library of

56:31.520 --> 56:32.740
human knowledge just to

56:32.740 --> 56:33.220
keep their printing

56:33.220 --> 56:33.980
presses running at

56:33.980 --> 56:34.820
maximum speed.

56:35.440 --> 56:35.940
And that thought

56:35.940 --> 56:37.080
brings us right back

56:37.080 --> 56:37.960
to where we started.

56:38.460 --> 56:39.500
That feeling of

56:39.500 --> 56:41.020
frictionless magic when

56:41.020 --> 56:41.880
you type a prompt.

56:42.300 --> 56:43.520
The machine whirls,

56:43.840 --> 56:44.660
the text appears,

56:44.960 --> 56:46.040
the code compiles.

56:46.400 --> 56:47.480
It feels clean.

56:48.340 --> 56:49.320
It feels like an x-ray

56:49.320 --> 56:50.040
pointing out a broken

56:50.040 --> 56:50.420
bone.

56:51.320 --> 56:52.760
But beneath the surface,

56:53.320 --> 56:54.420
the waters are deeply,

56:54.880 --> 56:56.220
profoundly murky.

56:56.220 --> 56:58.400
Thank you for joining us

56:58.400 --> 56:59.180
on this deep dive.

57:00.040 --> 57:01.060
As you go back to your

57:01.060 --> 57:02.580
screens today, remember

57:02.580 --> 57:03.720
to cultivate your taste.

57:04.360 --> 57:05.280
Embrace the productive

57:05.280 --> 57:06.540
friction of doing things

57:06.540 --> 57:07.840
the hard way, and

57:07.840 --> 57:09.360
whatever you do, don't be

57:09.360 --> 57:10.060
afraid to hit delete.

